  "label": "Goat is mapped as a speaker in heaven",
  "description": "The visual entity 'goat' is mapped onto the textual concept of 'speaking in heaven'. The goat's open mouth and expressive face, combined with the text 'i hear in heaven', create an analogical mapping where the goat is portrayed as the entity that is 'hearing' or 'speaking' from heaven. This mapping is reinforced by the surreal context of the text, which positions the goat as a participant in a heavenly scenario, even though it is an animal. The goat's anthropomorphic expression contributes to the humorous and absurd intent of the meme, aligning with the text's implication that the goat is the one 'hearing' or 'saying' the phrase.",
